{
  "_comment": "Sv39 no-fault PT config bounded to the C910's 40-bit PA. mmap high bound = 2^40; pa_and masks every PA to bits [39:12] (40-bit PA, 4KB aligned). Sv39 only; 4KB/2MB pages (satp PPN is 28 bits).",

  "mmap": [["0x80000000", "0x10000000000"]],

  "spaces": {
